# ==============================================================================
# PROJECT NYRA - MASTER ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE
# ==============================================================================
# Complete consolidated environment configuration for all services and PCs
# Version: 2.0 (Consolidated 2026-01-18)
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to .env: cp .env.master.template .env
# 2. Fill in all REQUIRED values (marked with comments)
# 3. Generate secrets: openssl rand -hex 32
# 4. Use Infisical for production (see INFISICAL-MIGRATION.md)
# 5. PC-specific configs: Use .env.orchestrator-mini, .env.worker-rtx3060, etc.
